    '= Guide\n\nPinned guide.\n\n[#navigation]\n== Navigation\n\nFirst version AsciiDoc navigation.\n\nRead the link:guide.md#navigation[available Markdown guide] and the link:appendix.adoc[omitted appendix].\n',
